    "stop_reason": "success",
    "result_text": "The change is complete and all tests pass.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe spec required the owner representation to expose a `selfLink` = `/api/owners/` + the owner's id. I implemented it following the project's standard Spring/OpenAPI-codegen conventions:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a `selfLink` read-only string property to the `Owner` schema (right after `id`). This regenerates the `OwnerDto` with a `selfLink` field.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Added a MapStruct `@Mapping` that derives `selfLink` on read as `\"/api/owners/\" + owner.getId()` (null-guarded when the owner has no id yet).\n\nBecause `getOwner`, `addOwner`, and the list endpoints all map through `toOwnerDto`, the `selfLink` is now populated consistently everywhere an owner is returned.\n\n- `AcceptanceTest.coreReturnsSelfLink` passes: `GET /api/owners/{id}` returns `$.selfLink` = `/api/owners/{id}`.\n- Full test suite: **BUILD SUCCESS** (Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0).",
